From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saon Islam <saonbd33@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci(instapaper): drop the dead daily cron, fix schedule-posts staging

Two things the page removal left behind:

- daily-read-link.yml is deleted: its first step runs
  `node scripts/daily-read-link.mjs`, which no longer exists, so the 09:00 UTC
  cron would fail every morning. sync-instapaper-bookmarks.mjs stays.
- schedule-posts.yml no longer stages `data/read-queue-state.json` in its
  bookmark commit — that file is gone, and `git add -f` fails on a missing
  path, so the step would have errored (workflow is currently disabled).

The bookmark sync itself is untouched and keeps working in both workflows.
Apply, commit, push, then delete this file.
---
diff --git a/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml b/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml
deleted file mode 100644
index 1373719..0000000
--- a/.github/workflows/daily-read-link.yml
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,59 +0,0 @@
-name: Daily read link
-
-# Every day at 09:00 UTC, pick the next unposted link from data/read-queue.json,
-# add it to your Instapaper "Tech News" folder, then sync that folder's bookmarks
-# into data/instapaper-bookmarks.json so the /read page on techtips.fun refreshes.
-#
-# The folder is configurable with the repository variable INSTAPAPER_FOLDER
-# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables). Default: "Tech News".
-#
-# Important: never put "[skip ci]" in the sync commit message below. Cloudflare
-# Workers Builds skips those commits, so /read would never rebuild.
-
-on:
-  schedule:
-    - cron: "0 9 * * *"
-  workflow_dispatch:
-
-permissions:
-  contents: write
-
-jobs:
-  daily-link:
-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
-    steps:
-      - name: Check out repository
-        uses: actions/checkout@v4
-
-      - name: Set up Node.js
-        uses: actions/setup-node@v4
-        with:
-          node-version: 22
-
-      - name: Add next link from read queue to Instapaper
-        env:
-          INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_KEY: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_KEY }}
-          INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_SECRET: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_SECRET }}
-          INSTAPAPER_EMAIL: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_EMAIL }}
-          INSTAPAPER_PASSWORD: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_PASSWORD }}
-          INSTAPAPER_FOLDER: ${{ vars.INSTAPAPER_FOLDER || 'Tech News' }}
-        run: node scripts/daily-read-link.mjs
-
-      - name: Sync Instapaper bookmarks to local JSON
-        env:
-          INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_KEY: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_KEY }}
-          INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_SECRET: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_CONSUMER_SECRET }}
-          INSTAPAPER_EMAIL: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_EMAIL }}
-          INSTAPAPER_PASSWORD: ${{ secrets.INSTAPAPER_PASSWORD }}
-          INSTAPAPER_FOLDER: ${{ vars.INSTAPAPER_FOLDER || 'Tech News' }}
-        run: node scripts/sync-instapaper-bookmarks.mjs
-
-      - name: Commit and push updated bookmarks
-        run: |
-          set -euo pipefail
-          git config user.name "github-actions[bot]"
-          git config user.email "41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com"
-          git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json data/read-queue-state.json
-          git diff --cached --quiet && exit 0
-          git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks"
-          git push
diff --git a/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml b/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
index 1f1c52f..7b75c73 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/schedule-posts.yml
@@ -122,7 +122,7 @@ jobs:
           set -euo pipefail
           git config user.name "github-actions[bot]"
           git config user.email "41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com"
-          git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json data/read-queue-state.json
+          git add -f data/instapaper-bookmarks.json
           git diff --cached --quiet && exit 0
           git commit -m "chore: sync Instapaper bookmarks after publish [skip ci]"
           git pull --rebase origin main || true
